SUMMARY:Signs of Suicide (SOS) Parent/Caregiver Presentation
DESCRIPTION:This informative session is designed to help parents and caregivers better understand youth mental health\, recognize warning signs of depression and suicide\, and learn how to support young people who may be struggling. \nThe program is intended to empower families with the knowledge and tools to foster open conversations about mental health and connect youth to help when needed. \nRegister to attend the FREE virtual event: \nhttps://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/CRVwKlX2SRSfIr5LWPMfCQ
URL:https://www.mhainspire.org/event/signs-of-suicide-sos-parent-caregiver-presentation/
LOCATION:Virtual
CATEGORIES:NJ4S
END:VEVENT
